    "identifier": "futton-boil-release-scorpions-stinger",
    "description": "<p>You coat your body in a highly compressed cloak of steam, that you then shape into a stinger the same shape as a Scorpions.</p>\n<p>For the duration, you can spend your Bonus Action to make a melee ninjutsu (or taijutsu) attack against a creature in range with the steam stinger, dealing [Unarmed Damage] + 4d12 acid damage and the target must make a Constitution saving throw, gaining 3 ranks of Scald on a failure.</p>\n<p>At Higher Ranks: For each rank you cast this jutsu above B-Rank, increase the cost of this jutsu by 3 and damage by 1d12.</p>",
